// The Sundering (Armageddon, 90, sharing the slot with Wrath; the owner's design, 2026-11-08; the
// card is code: crates/ffh-core/src/deck/doom_cards.rs, its rules crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/sundering.rs).
