// civilization, led by one of that civilization's leaders not in play, else by one of its minor
// leaders (`minor_leader_of`): FFH2's scenario leaders in leader_heads.jsonc, and the ones below,
// invented for the civilizations that have none. The new leaders show the random portrait.
